# Explicit type registrations for this directory.
#
# Without them the directory is an implicit one, and Quickshell's QML
# scanner registers it lazily: the FIRST type looked up in a
# not-yet-registered directory fails with "<T> is not a type", and which
# type that is varies from run to run. Reproduced on this machine with
# `NBadge is not a type` from widgets-nothing/battery/main.qml while every
# other primitive in the same file resolved. A qmldir makes the directory
# an explicit module directory, so every type is known before first use.
NBadge 1.0 NBadge.qml
NButton 1.0 NButton.qml
NCard 1.0 NCard.qml
NDial 1.0 NDial.qml
NDivider 1.0 NDivider.qml
NDotField 1.0 NDotField.qml
NDotMatrix 1.0 NDotMatrix.qml
NFrost 1.0 NFrost.qml
NLabel 1.0 NLabel.qml
NMono 1.0 NMono.qml
NProgress 1.0 NProgress.qml
NText 1.0 NText.qml
NTheme 1.0 NTheme.qml
